WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
The second reason why people are lazy is because you're afraid.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000
You're afraid.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You're afraid of actually doing the thing that you want to do.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
You know what your Michael Jordan level talent is.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
You know where your ET level talent is, but you're afraid to chase it down.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
You're afraid to take the stage.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
You're afraid to make that call.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
You're afraid to say, here's what I do.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.000
You're afraid to bet on yourself.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
You're afraid.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
So laziness or procrastination comes from not having a dream

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
or having one and being afraid of it.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Either way, the answer is action.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
If you don't know what your dream is, your answer is to go and take immediate action

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.000
to try out as many things as possible.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
To say yes, to try anything once to find your dream.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Or if your problem is you know your dream, but you're afraid of it, then the answer is still action.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
You have to get up and do it because otherwise you will live the rest of your life in regret

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
knowing that you could have done more.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Knowing that you lived your life doing things that you hated.

